  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "F25Kicker",
      "text": "STUDIO MATERIALS / SET EX01 / REVISION 01"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Material sample catalogue"
    },
    {
      "style": "Subtitle",
      "text": "Surface specimens for an exhibition mockup"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Use this register to identify three specimens, compare their recorded sizes and plan the next check.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Specimen register"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Read the evidence before comparing"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "E1 = authored example value or observation. E2 = external record with a citation and method. U =…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Decision and next verification"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Begin the mockup trial with A01 because its nominal footprint matches the face. A03 remains an…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Compare nominal footprint only. These diagrams do not prove color, texture, thickness, stiffness, fire…"
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Footer",
      "text": "EX01 / 01 OCT 2026 / FICTIONAL STUDIO RECORDS / REGISTER 1 OF 4"
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Kicker",
      "text": "SPECIMEN 01 / SET EX01"
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Identifier",
      "text": "A01"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Scored board"
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Caption",
      "text": "Illustrative surface detail. Not to scale; the square is not the specimen outline."
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Caption",
      "text": "Print check: 50 mm between end ticks at 100% scale."
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Footer",
      "text": "EX01 / REV 01 / FICTIONAL / 2 OF 4"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Specification and provenance"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Observation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The diagram shows parallel score lines and a square edge. It illustrates the record; it is not a…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Practical limitation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "U: fold endurance and fixing strength are untested. The drawn lines do not establish flexibility."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Next verification"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Measure the real piece and trial the intended fixing on a spare offcut."
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Kicker",
      "text": "SPECIMEN 02 / SET EX01"
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Identifier",
      "text": "A02"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Fibre mat"
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Caption",
      "text": "Illustrative surface detail. Not to scale; the square is not the specimen outline."
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Caption",
      "text": "Print check: 50 mm between end ticks at 100% scale."
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Footer",
      "text": "EX01 / REV 01 / FICTIONAL / 3 OF 4"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Specification and provenance"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Observation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Short crossing marks indicate an invented fibrous surface. The nominal length is 10 mm less than A01…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Practical limitation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "U: supplier, batch and fiber composition are unknown. Appearance cannot establish any of them."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Next verification"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Locate the source record, then check edge stability on the actual sample."
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Kicker",
      "text": "SPECIMEN 03 / SET EX01"
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Identifier",
      "text": "A03"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Granule sheet"
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Caption",
      "text": "Illustrative surface detail. Not to scale; the square is not the specimen outline."
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Caption",
      "text": "Print check: 50 mm between end ticks at 100% scale."
    },
    {
      "style": "F25Footer",
      "text": "EX01 / REV 01 / FICTIONAL / 4 OF 4"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Specification and provenance"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Observation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Irregular outlined granules describe an invented surface. Its nominal footprint matches A01; its…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Practical limitation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "U: compression and shedding are untested. Nominal thickness does not predict their results."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Next verification"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Measure thickness without compressing the piece; document the method and trial a fixing."
    }
  ],
